---

{title: Aaja Mere Mahi}
{artist: Tujhe Milke Laga Hai Sharib Toshi}
{key: Am}

{c: Verse 1}
[Am]Tujhe Milke Laga Hai Ye,        [Am]Tujhe Dhundh Raha Tha Main
[Am]Tujhme Hai Kuch Aisi Subah Sa,        [G]Jiski Khaatir Main Tha Jaga Sa
[F]Aa Tu Mera Khwab Sajaa Ja [E]Re,        ..Maahi Aaja Re, Maahi Aaja Re
[Am]Tujhme Hai Kuch Aisi Subah Sa,        [G]Jiski Khaatir Main Tha Jaga Sa
[F]Aa Tu Mera Khwab Sajaa Ja [E]Re,        [Am]Dil Roye Ya Ilahi [G]Tu Aaja Mere Mahi
[F]Dil Roye Ya Ilahi [G]Tu Aaja Mere Mahi,        [Am]Maahi Maahi Maahi [G]Maahi Maahi Mahi
[F]Dhadkano Me Maahi [G]Saanso Me Hai Mahi,        [Am]Tu Hi Hai Mere Dil Ki Tamanna
[G]Teri Hi Yaadein Har Lamha,        [F]De Mujhe De Apna Aanchal
[G]Dhoop Me Jalta Main Harpal,        [Am]Tujhme Hai Kuch Aisi Ghataa Sa
[G]Jiske Liye Hu Main Pyaasa Sa,        [F]Aa Tu Meri Pyaas Bujha Ja [E]Re
[Am]Dil Roye Ya Ilahi [G]Tu Aaja Mere Mahi,        [F]Dil Roye Ya Ilahi [G]Tu Aaja Mere Mahi
[Am]Maahi Maahi Maahi [G]Maahi Maahi Mahi,        [F]Bas Mera Tu Maahi [G]Saanso Me Hai Mahi
[Am]Hain Mujhe Hai Tera Armaan,        [G]Hai Tujhe Hai Mera Banna
[F]Har Ghadi Teri Dil Me Aahat,        [G]Tu Mile Mil Jaaye Raahat
[Am]Jud Ke Bhi Tu Mujhse Juda Sa,        [G]Milke Bhi Tu Kyu Hai Khafaa Sa
[F]Aaja Meri Baaho Me Aaja [E]Re,        [Am]Dil Roye Ya Ilahi [G]Tu Aaja Mere Mahi
[F]Dil Roye Ya Ilahi [G]Tu Aaja Mere Mahi
